#: functions.php:117
msgid ""
"This will serve widgets (blocks) to the top sidebar of any non-page areas of "
"your website.\n"
"\t\t\tThis includes any section of your site that is not explicitly built as "
"a page (posts, 404, search, etc.).\n"
"\t\t\tThis sidebar includes a sticky feature that can be toggled on and off "
"in the Navigation section of the \n"
"\t\t\tcustomizer.  If you add a Main Sidebar 2, then this sidebar will "
"remain static, and sidebar 2 will\n"
"\t\t\tbecome sticky.  If a main sidebar menu is used, then the widgets "
"(blocks) for this area will be \n"
"\t\t\tfeatured below it."
