#: inc/customizer.php:788
msgid "Sticky Sidebar"
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:797
msgid ""
"If a sidebar is being used, and a reduced sidebar is shorter than the body,\n"
"    then turning this on will cause the sidebar to shrink in size if it is "
"big \n"
"    and become its own window with its own scrollbar, and it will stick into "
"position when you scroll down the screen.\n"
"    This feature is not available on all browsers."
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:818
msgid "Sticky Title On Mobile"
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:827
msgid ""
"Turning this off will remove most of the navbar (except the menu button) "
"when scrolling down mobile screens \n"
"    (screens with a width less than 1065px).  If you do not have a title in "
"the navbar, then only the menu button is \n"
"    dsiplayed regarless of the status of this control."
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:833
msgid "Layout"
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:844
msgid "Header Space for Featured Media"
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:850 inc/customizer.php:876
msgid "Featured Images Only"
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:854
msgid ""
"This will move the text down the width of the screen on single pages and "
"posts\n"
"    so that feaured and background images and videos receive more exposure.  "
"If you find this control confusing, then\n"
"    it is best to leave it in the <u>Featured Images Only</u> position."
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:870
msgid "Page Titles"
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:880
msgid ""
"This controls whether page titles are displayed on pages (not posts).\n"
"    The <u>Featured Images Only</u> option is designed to show a title only "
"when the featured image takes up the \n"
"    entire page.  This can be controlled witn the header space control.  If "
"you find this control confusing, then\n"
"    it is best to leave it in the <u>Featured Images Only</u> position."
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:893
msgid "Big Pages"
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:902
msgid ""
"This will widen the width of the body to the full width of the screen \n"
"    and bring the page closer to the top if there is no header or featured "
"media on pages (not posts) when the \n"
"    sidebar isn't present.  Note that bringing the page close to the top can "
"be offset by the \n"
"    <u>Page Titles</u> control and the <u>Header Space for Featured Media</"
"u>.  If you get confused, then it is\n"
"    best to reset both controls to <u>Featured Images Only</u>."
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:920
msgid "Excerpt Mode"
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:929
msgid ""
"This will turrn off excerpt mode for the post and archive results pages, but "
"it will leave it on\n"
