#: inc/customizer.php:991
msgid ""
"You have two kinds of sidebars.  One pair can be used in pages.  Thee other "
"pair can be used in posts.\n"
"    You can use this radio button to control which pages your page sidebars "
"appear on.  Note that if\n"
"    you choose <u>Home Only</u> or <u>Except Home</u>, your homepage must be "
"defined as a static page in <u>Homepage Settings</u>."
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:997
msgid "Background Media"
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:999
msgid ""
"You can use this section to set mobile friendly background images and "
"videos\n"
"        into different areas of your site, inlcluding area not covered by "
"header media and featured media."
