#: inc/customizer.php:1011
msgid "Load a Background Image."
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:1014
msgid ""
"The background image has been designed to be mobile friendly.\n"
"        It will serve as your default background image.  It will be replaced "
"on your homepage\n"
"        if you use header media or on pages that have added a featured image "
"or on\n"
"        pages set as <i>Big Pages</i> in the <u>Layout</u> section."
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:1028
msgid "Load a Background Video."
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:1031
msgid ""
"The background video has been designed to be mobile friendly.\n"
"        It will serve as your default background video.  It will be replaced "
"on your homepage\n"
"        if you use header media or on pages that have added a featured image "
"or on\n"
"        pages set as <i>Big Pages</i> in the <u>Layout</u> section."
